{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/binghatti-luxuria-jumeirah-village-triangle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1404,"crm_id":"7480","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Binghatti Luxuria","slug":"binghatti-luxuria-jumeirah-village-triangle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Triangle (JVT)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Binghatti","price":766000,"display_price":"766k","lattitude":25.042470645023,"longitude":55.18959384353,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Binghatti Luxuria JVT is a contemporary residential development by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-binghatti/\">Binghatti Holding</a>, located in the heart of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/jumeirah-village-triangle/\">Jumeirah Village Triangle</a>. The project features a carefully structured mix of <strong>studios, one-bedroom apartments, two-bedroom apartments, and exclusive two-bedroom Royal Suites</strong>, each designed with efficiency, privacy, and comfort in mind.</p><p>Rising across 24 residential floors, the tower blends modernist architecture with refined interiors and thoughtfully planned layouts. Retail spaces at ground level and a dedicated lifestyle podium further enhance daily convenience. With competitive entry prices and a balanced unit mix, Binghatti Luxuria appeals to both end-users and investors seeking value within a well-connected Dubai community.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_4bf3adcb5d.jpg","hash":"Feature_4bf3adcb5d","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_f53821701f.jpg","hash