,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Architectural Calm: A modernist façade designed to balance light, privacy, and visual rhythm</li><li>Curated Residences: Well-proportioned studios and apartments with efficient layouts</li><li>Resort-Style Living: Amenities designed to disconnect residents from city intensity</li><li>Prime JVT Address: Peaceful surroundings with city-wide accessibility</li><li>Quality Craftsmanship: Premium materials and refined interior finishes</li><li>Lifestyle-Oriented Design: Spaces planned for comfort, wellness, and flow</li><li>Retail Convenience: Ground-floor retail adding daily-life convenience</li><li>Investor-Friendly Scale: Unit mix aligned with strong rental demand</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2042,"cta":{"id":2872,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/location_7025e7d5cb.jpg","hash":"location_7025e7d5cb","name":"location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Binghatti Luxuria Jumeirah Village Triangle","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Binghatti Luxuria is located in Jumeirah Village Triangle, one of Dubai’s most balanced residential communities known for its greenery, accessibility, and livability. JVT offers a calm suburban environment while remaining closely connected to Dubai Marina, JBR, and major business districts.</p><p>The community benefits from direct access to Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, making daily commuting seamless. Surrounded by schools, parks, retail outlets, and leisure destinations, JVT continues to attract professionals and families seeking a quieter lifestyle without compromising connectivity.</p><ul><li>9 Minutes – Dubai Marina</li><li>9 Minutes – Ain Dubai</li><li>12 Minutes – Palm Jumeirah</li><li>18 Mi